</p><h4>Figure 3: Both exports and imports of goods increased in Quarter 1 2026</h4><h6>Changes in exports and imports of goods, excluding unspecified and semi-manufactured goods, £ billion, Quarter 1 (Jan to Mar) 2026 compared with Quarter 4 (Oct to Dec) 2025</h6><p><div class="js--show">

